[{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03021800_02_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03021800_02_0010","text":"（在这边拍一张吧……）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03021800_02_0020","text":"（这个角度是最佳──）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03021800_02_0030","text":"────拍照？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03021800_02_0040","text":"啊，抱歉！\n差点不小心拍进去了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03021800_02_0050","text":"…………没事"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03021800_02_0060","text":"……那个，路加小姐\n合宿的照片会发到推文上之类的吗……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03021800_02_0070","text":"──没兴趣"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03021800_02_0080","text":"这样啊……\n说了多余的话，抱歉"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03021800_02_0090","text":"────…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03021800_02_0100","text":"──要拍的吧\n照片"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03021800_02_0101","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03021800_02_0110","text":"辛苦了……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03021800_02_0111","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03021800_02_0112","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03021800_02_0113","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03021800_02_0120","text":"就这种程度吧……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03021800_02_0121","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03021800_02_0122","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03021800_02_0123","text":"Twister的评论"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03021800_02_0130","text":"“斑鸠路加你在那里吗？”"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03021800_02_0140","text":"（…………算了算了，本人又没那个兴致\n　不能随便乱发）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03021800_02_0150","text":"“今天也练习了！还是精神满满！\n　#大家也精神的话我会很开心”"}]
